  m_text: '[U]: Reduce the health of all enemies and bosses by 20% of their maximum
    health.

    [J]: Instantly eliminate all enemies in the scene (Kill All).

    [K]:
    Eliminate only the enemy closest to the player.

    [V]: Instantly order all
    bosses to use their Summon skill.

    [1]: Instantly order all bosses to use
    their Void Zone skill.

    [Y]: Order the boss to use its final skill and die
    instantly.

    [2]: Skip the current wave to the next wave immediately.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
